E .  \r\nI am not expert in bsf so not sure creating s_nssi + dnn is correct ot can add supi also for session.\r\n\r\nthe case is in this function : bsf_state_operational line num line num 141 while adding new UE it skip as same session is there .\r\nand while delete the error skip is bsf_nbsf_management_handle_pcf_binding  55\r\n\r\nso 2nd UE when come bsf returns no session HTTP error .\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/1256232123/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/1256245365","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1725#issuecomment-1256245365","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1725","id":1256245365,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBM4HkM5K4Mh1","user":{"login":"acetcom","id":4222492,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMjI0OTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4222492?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom","html_url":"https://github.com/acetcom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-09-23T13:52:07Z","updated_at":"2022-09-23T13:52:07Z","body":"@prasenjitpdas \r\n\r